{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，毕竟还顶着张安洁的脸呢……」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，就是这样的事情。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……可是，为什么濑名同学和天羽学姐会因为这点小事感到为难呢？", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "……可是，为什么濑名同学和天羽学姐会因为这点小事感到为难呢？", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
