{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「自己不做的话就冷静不下来」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0757", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的房间已经够干净了啊……」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？！」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0840", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那安洁来检查一下您打扫过的地方，如果没打扫干净的话我来处理……」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "「那安洁来检查一下您打扫过的地方，如果没打扫干净的话我来处理……」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0841", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0758", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、我在」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0842", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家已经不用了」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0759", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜啊啊～不管是谁家都这么说～～」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": "「呜啊啊～不管是谁家都这么说～～」", "plain_idx": 391, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0843", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我想也是啊。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁虽然非常有干劲，但是过于热情反而让人有些手足无措。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "安洁虽然非常有干劲，但是过于热情反而让人有些手足无措。", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概濑名同学、天羽学姐，还有乾同学，都是吃了苦头才让安洁回去的吧……", "text_idx": 395, "plain": "大概濑名同学、天羽学姐，还有乾同学，都是吃了苦头才让安洁回去的吧……", "plain_idx": 395, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、呜、今天打扰了……」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0844", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，安洁并没有完全发挥作用……倒不如说她一点都没发挥作用就回去了。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "结果，安洁并没有完全发挥作用……倒不如说她一点都没发挥作用就回去了。", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
